# Cloudflare Pages — Redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# Normalise www → apex
https://www.brasa.world/* https://brasa.world/:splat 301

# Remove trailing slash (except root)
/es/   /es   301
/pt/   /pt   301
/fr/   /fr   301

# Legacy URL support (if any old links exist)
/home  /  301
/index  /  301
/index.htm  /  301

# No SPA catch-all — BRASA serves real .html files.
# Pages serves each page directly and returns a normal 404 for unknown paths.
# If you add a custom 404 page later, uncomment the next line:
# /*  /404.html  404
